$ ----------------------------------------------------------------------
$ Wave-induced set-up on a sloping beach, one-dimensional
$ The cross-shore profile of setup2d.swn: 2 km, depth from 10 m to 0.5 m.
$ In a one-dimensional run SETUPP integrates the radiation stress
$ gradient along the profile itself, without SETUP2D.
$ ----------------------------------------------------------------------

PROJECT 'SETUP' '1D'
SET NAUTICAL
MODE STATIONARY ONEDIMENSIONAL
COORDINATES CARTESIAN

CGRID REGULAR 0.0 0.0 0.0 2000.0 0.0 40 0 CIRCLE 36 0.05 1.0 24
INPGRID BOTTOM REGULAR 0.0 0.0 0.0 40 0 50.0 50.0
READINP BOTTOM 1.0 'slope1d.bot' 3 0 FREE

WIND 10.0 250.0
BOUND SHAPESPEC JONSWAP 3.3 PEAK DSPR DEGREES
BOUNDSPEC SIDE WEST CONSTANT PAR 1.5 8.0 250.0 20.0

GEN3 KOMEN
BREAKING CONSTANT 1.0 0.73
FRICTION JONSWAP CONSTANT 0.038
SETUP
NUMERIC STOPC 0.001 0.01 0.001 99.5 STAT 30

$ BLOCK output is not available in a one-dimensional run.
POINTS 'LINE' 0. 0. 500. 0. 1000. 0. 1500. 0. 1800. 0. 1900. 0. 1950. 0.
TABLE 'LINE' HEADER 'setup1d.tbl' XP YP DEPTH HSIGN SETUP TM01 DIR

COMPUTE
STOP
